This repository redistributes a quantised build of Gemma 4 E2B:

  gemma-4-E2B-it-qat-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf
  from https://huggingface.co/unsloth/gemma-4-E2B-it-qat-GGUF (Unsloth),
  quantised from https://huggingface.co/google/gemma-4-E2B-it-qat-q4_0-unquantized (Google),
  itself the quantisation-aware-trained version of https://huggingface.co/google/gemma-4-E2B-it.

Gemma 4 is released by Google under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/gemma_4_license); the quantised files by
Unsloth carry the same licence. The file here is the unmodified GGUF from
Unsloth, only split into two parts with llama.cpp's gguf-split so that each
part stays under GitHub's release-asset limit; the first part opens the
whole model.

Copyright for the model weights: Google LLC. Quantisation: Unsloth.

The ear (release ear-v1) is Cnam-LMSSC/wav2vec2-french-phonemizer
(https://huggingface.co/Cnam-LMSSC/wav2vec2-french-phonemizer, MIT licence,
a fine-tune of facebook/wav2vec2-base-fr-voxpopuli-v2 on Common Voice 13
French), exported to ONNX and quantised to int8 without other changes.
